>> title: Green Goddess Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: herbs, anchovy, salad, dip, blender
>> counters: Diner, Deli, The Bowl Shop
>> servings: 10
>> time: 15 min
>> step.1: blend to a coarse purée
>> step.2: blend in
>> step.3: blend smooth
>> step.4: season

Blend @flat-leaf parsley{1%cup}(packed leaves), @chives{1/4%cup}(sliced), @fresh tarragon{2%Tbs}(leaves only), and @scallions{2}(green tops only) with @lemon juice{2%Tbs}(30 mL) to a coarse purée in a #blender{}.

Blend @anchovy fillets{3}(oil-packed) and @garlic{1%clove} into @&(~1)herb purée{}.

Blend @mayonnaise{3/4%cup}(180 mL) and @sour cream{1/2%cup}(120 mL) into @&(~1)base{} until pale green and smooth.

Season @&(~1)dressing{} with @kosher salt{1/2%tsp} and @black pepper{1/4%tsp}.
